<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
<div class="container" style="max-width:900px;" dir="ltr">
<span class="eyebrow">Rasilimali za kilimo</span><h1>Rasilimali za kilimo</h1><p class="lede">Kituo cha rasilimali kilichopangwa kusaidia kupata fedha za kilimo, ruzuku, mitambo, vifaa na huduma zinazohusiana. Rasilimali zinalenga kuthibitishwa na kusimamiwa kupitia CMS ya GoOrganicAfrica.</p><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:32px;">
<a class="ebook-card" href="/sw/agricultural-finance/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Fedha za kilimo</h2><p>Mikopo, bima, ufadhili wa pembejeo, ufadhili wa vifaa, ukodishaji na njia nyingine za fedha za kilimo.</p></a>
<a class="ebook-card" href="/sw/agricultural-grants/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Ruzuku na fursa</h2><p>Ruzuku, misaada, mashindano, programu za vijana na wanawake, mafunzo na fursa nyingine za kilimo.</p></a>
<a class="ebook-card" href="/sw/farm-machinery/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Mitambo ya kilimo</h2><p>Matrekta, mashine za kupanda, wavunaji, umwagiliaji, usindikaji, greenhouses na vifaa vingine vya kilimo.</p></a></div>
<div style="margin-top:36px;">
  <h2>Saraka ya nchi 54 za Afrika</h2>
  <p>Rasilimali rasmi za kila nchi zinathibitishwa.</p>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px;">
    {% for country in agriculturalResources.countries %}
    <details style="padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;">{{ country.flag }} {{ country.name }}</summary>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;">
        {% for category in agriculturalResources.categories %}
          {% if country.records[category] and country.records[category] | length %}
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem;margin:14px 0 8px;">{% if category == "finance" %}Fedha{% elif category == "grants" %}Ruzuku{% elif category == "machinery" %}Mitambo{% else %}Rasilimali za jumla{% endif %}</h3>
            {% for record in country.records[category] %}
            <div style="padding:12px;margin:8px 0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;">
              <strong>{% if language == "fr" and record.localized.fr %}{{ record.localized.fr.title }}{% elif language == "ar" and record.localized.ar %}{{ record.localized.ar.title }}{% elif language == "pt" and record.localized.pt %}{{ record.localized.pt.title }}{% elif language == "sw" and record.localized.sw %}{{ record.localized.sw.title }}{% else %}{{ record.title }}{% endif %}</strong>
              <p style="margin:6px 0;">{% if language == "fr" and record.localized.fr %}{{ record.localized.fr.description }}{% elif language == "ar" and record.localized.ar %}{{ record.localized.ar.description }}{% elif language == "pt" and record.localized.pt %}{{ record.localized.pt.description }}{% elif language == "sw" and record.localized.sw %}{{ record.localized.sw.description }}{% else %}{{ record.description }}{% endif %}</p>
              <div style="font-size:.82rem;opacity:.78;">Chanzo: {{ record.source }} · Imethibitishwa: {{ record.verified }}</div>
              <a href="{{ record.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fungua chanzo rasmi →</a>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
<div style="margin-top:36px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><h2>Uthibitishaji ni muhimu</h2><p>Ofa za fedha na vifaa zinaweza kubadilika, kufungwa au kuwa na masharti ya kustahiki. GoOrganicAfrica itachapisha rasilimali zinazotumika pamoja na viungo rasmi na tarehe za uthibitishaji zinapopatikana.</p></div>
</div></section>